  "kvalitet": "The data layer is based on species distribution modelling focusing on mature flounder at the spawning stage and should be considered a rough estimation. The studies from which the thresholds values for environmental variables have been obtained are based on publications conducted before the separation of Baltic flounder from European flounder but have taken the specific characteristics of the separate spawning ecotypes into account.",
